  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cambodia and Lao PDR Young Leaders Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Activity will contribute to a stronger civil society, improved sustainable development and strengthened governance practices in&#xA0;Cambodia and Lao PDR by delivering a capacity building programme to 18 emerging civil society leaders from both countries&#xA0;over two years.</narrative>
